<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Alex. Brown Inc as neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown gained 3/8 to 61-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Earlier this week, Alex Brown agreed to merge with Bankers Trust New York Corp.</p>
